{#
  Head of a customer mail (block GARAN, part 2, L1, L4): the shop's logo,
  embedded under its cid (MailFrame). Nothing without one.

  ABOVE the white column, on the grey ground: included in the outer cell, before the
  600 px table, and as wide as it. Variable: frame {company, address,
  footer, logo: {cid, width}|null} — or null.
#}
{% if frame.logo|default(null) %}
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding: 0 0 16px 0;"><img src="cid:{{ frame.logo.cid }}" alt="{{ frame.company }}" width="{{ frame.logo.width }}" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: {{ frame.logo.width }}px; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border: 0;"></td></tr>
</table>
{% endif %}
